Package: ckdata
Title: Query the CourseKata Data Lake
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Adam", "Blake", email = "adam@ablake.dev", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A thin R interface to the CourseKata analytical data lake: get lazy
    dbplyr table references into the lake and cache large query results to disk.
    The Amazon Athena connection is managed for you; queries are written with
    dbplyr.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    arrow,
    DBI,
    dbplyr (< 2.6.0),
    digest,
    dplyr,
    noctua
Suggests:
    RSQLite,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/coursekata/ckdata-r
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
